## 4.3 Behavioral Patterns Summary

The Online Book Store implements two behavioral patterns:

### Strategy Pattern
- **Interface**: [SortStrategy](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/SortStrategy.java#9-12)
- **Implementations**: 5 concrete strategies
- **Context**: [BookService](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/BookService.java#9-27)
- **Purpose**: Flexible book sorting algorithms

### Observer Pattern
- **Subject Interface**: `OrderSubject`
- **Observer Interface**: [OrderObserver](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/OrderObserver.java#5-13)
- **Concrete Subject**: [OrderService](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/OrderService.java#11-134)
- **Concrete Observer**: [InventoryService](file:///c:/Users/Ahmed/IdeaProjects/Online-Book-Store/src/main/java/com/example/onlinebookstore/Models/InventoryService.java#9-46)
- **Purpose**: Automatic inventory updates on order confirmation

### Pattern Integration

```
Controller
    ↓
BookStoreFacade.confirmOrder()
    ↓
OrderService.confirmOrder() [Subject]
    ↓
notifyObservers() triggered
    ↓
InventoryService.onOrderConfirmed() [Observer]
    ↓
BookDAO.updateBookStock()
```

### Benefits Summary

| Pattern | Key Benefit | Extensibility |
|---------|-------------|---------------|
| **Strategy** | Runtime algorithm selection | Add new sorting without modifying existing code |
| **Observer** | Loose coupling between order and inventory | Add new observers (email, analytics) easily |

